//                                         for perfect-gold products.
//   useItemOnItem(wool, unstrung)         backpack: unstrung -> strung, +40 crafting xp
//   opHeldT(target, slot, spell.com)      THE SLOT'S OBJ ID CHANGES (inv_setslot). Inventory LENGTH
//                                         does not move — a count-based detector is blind here.
//
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
