// PACKET: useItemOnItem(NEEDLE, needleSlot, LEATHER, leatherSlot)
//   -> [opheldu,needle] 'case leather' -> @craft_leather_interface -> if_openmain(leather_crafting).
//      mainModalId becomes LEATHER_CRAFTING.ROOT. THREAD IS CHECKED BEFORE THE INTERFACE OPENS: with
